projmux

Commands:
  agent     Manage Agent state, messages, waits, capabilities, integrations, and account usage
  attention View and manage live tmux pane attention state
  attach    Enter a Project runtime from outside tmux
  config    Edit AI split-mode and enabled-provider settings; render or apply generated tmux configuration
  create    Create Projmux resources
  delete    Delete Projmux resources with an explicit cascade plan
  describe  Describe one Projmux resource
  doctor    Run read-only runtime and integration diagnostics
  diagnostics  Read operational events or create an explicit local support report
  focus     Move the current client to a live resource
  get       Read Projmux resources by selector
  hook      List, edit, validate, and trust lifecycle hook config
  notification  Manage pending notification workflow state
  open      Open a Project runtime and move the current client to it
  persona   List, show, edit, set, and delete Agent persona files
  pin       Manage pinned project directories
  prune     Prune stale Projects and Agents
  quit      Quit the app-owned projmux tmux runtime
  reconcile Preview or repair Registry and exact tmux resource drift
  rebind    Rebind a Project to a new absolute root without moving files
  rename    Rename a Projmux resource metadata.name
  resources Inspect live Project, Window, and Pane CPU/RSS attribution
  runtime   Manage the live and ephemeral tmux runtime inventory
  settings  Configure projmux
  setup     Probe terminal keys or remediate them with setup terminal
  shell     Open the isolated projmux tmux app
  start     Start a Project runtime without moving any client
  stop      Stop a Project runtime without unregistering anything
  switch    Pick a project and compose create project with open project
  unregister  Unregister Projects from the Registry while preserving runtime and files
  update    Check installer-aware release update status
  web       Serve the HTTP API and browser client
  welcome   Reprint the shell welcome guide
  window    Open recent window navigation surfaces
  help      Show bootstrap help
  version   Print the current version
